/1",{"ana":55},"#text_condition.incomplete",{"lettering":57,"dimensions":58},"From the drawing, appear deeply cut letters without marked serifs, of a slightly irregular module. Alpha with straight bar; M with vertical outer strokes and all full length; omicron nearly full size; omega closed and rhomboid. Line 1 appears to be clearly bigger than lines 2-4. (measurements taken from the drawing)",[59,65,70],{"type":60,"l":61,"from":62,"to":62,"h":63,"unit":64},"letterHeight","Line 1","line1","20","mm",{"type":60,"l":66,"from":67,"to":68,"h":69,"unit":64},"Line 2-4","line2","line4","12-15",{"type":71,"l":72,"from":62,"to":67,"unit":64},"interlinear","Interlineation line 1 to 2",{"_":74,"notBefore":75,"notAfter":76,"evidence":77},"Later 2nd or 1st century BCE",-150,-1,"lettering",[79,84],{"_":80,"type":81,"ref":82,"region":83},"Syracusae","ancient","http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462503","Sicilia",{"_":85,"type":86,"ref":87,"region":83},"Siracusa","modern","http://sws.geonames.org/2523083",[89],[90,91],37.08415,15.27628,[],"Sicily",{"_":95,"role":96,"ref":97},"Museo Archeologico Regionale Paolo Orsi","museum","http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/museum/097",{"_":99,"mainLang":100,"languages":101},"Ancient Greek","grc",[99],{"n":103,"url":104,"height":105,"width":106,"desc":107,"surfaceType":108},"screen","ISic003174_tiled.tif","769px","943px","I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana: drawing of Cultrera, MAL 1951: 811 fig.87","front",[],[111,111,112,113,114,115],"Supplementum epigraphicum graecum, 1923-","Bulletin épigraphique, 1888-","Cultrera, 1951, L'Apollonion-Artemision di Ortigia in Siracusa","Dimartino, 2009, Indagini paleografiche e prospettive storiche sulle iscrizioni greche di Sicilia (IV-I sec. a.C.)","Manganaro, 1999, Sikelika: studi di antichità e di epigrafia della Sicilia greca",[117,117,118,119,120,121],"F2GG87EQ","77P5MNIR","D44T3NE2",